#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — instrumenta astronomica coniuncta ad parandum, observandum, imagines capiendas et scientiam."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algorithmi: praecessio et nutatio IAU 2006, ephemerides JPL DE440 (SPK) aut analyticae Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nclaritas caeli Krisciunas & Schaefer, limina visualia Schaefer, congruentia stellarum triangulis immutabilis cum RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nacervatio cum reiectione kappa-sigma, winsorizata, aptationis linearis et ESD generalis, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy cum variatione tota (Dey et al.), undulae starlet (Starck & Murtagh), extensio hyperbolica generalis,\nlucky imaging multorum punctorum, derotatio sphaerica planetarum, Lomb-Scargle generalis, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, exemplar transitus generis Mandel-Agol cum MCMC communi."

